The dependency from "FindRemainders" to "FormEquations" is indeed unnecessary because the remainders \( R(x) \) are already determined in the "FindRemainders" task. The equations can be set up directly after determining \( R(x) \). Therefore, the direct linking of "SolveSystemOfEquations" from "FindRemainders" would streamline the TG and remove redundancy.

